EuroZig is a community of European Zig enthusiasts. We host events and support
the Zig ecosystem. We are in the process of setting up a German non-profit to
do this.

= Our Mission

== Hosting Conferences and Workshops

We want to host and help with the organization of conferences, workshops and
Zig Days. Our first conference will be Zigtoberfest 2027.

== Supporting the Zig Ecosystem

We aim to help important projects in the Zig ecosystem by applying for grants.

= Join us

If you are interested in joining us, come to our founding meeting or sign up
to the mailing list at #link("https://eurozig.eu")[eurozig.eu] — #pill[♥ donate]
